<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.185 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.185 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 7.185 percent.</p>
<p>In a tender on December 12, $100 million of the same bonds yielded an average 7.108 percent.  </p>
<p>Bids totalled $275 million in Thursday's tender and the successful bids ranged from 7.17 to 7.19 percent.</p>
<p>Settlement date is February 4.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
